Hi Avery,

Here's what shipped in Notion this month for your workspace:

- Database automations now trigger on property changes, not just page creation. Set up a "when Status becomes Done, notify channel" flow in about a minute.
- Forms are out of beta. Collect intake requests straight into a database, no third-party tool needed.
- Notion Mail is now available to every Plus and Business workspace admin.
- Faster search: we rebuilt the index and median search latency dropped 40%.

Read the full release notes: https://mail.notion.so/c/aug-release-4k2m

Tip of the month: press Cmd+Shift+P anywhere in Notion to jump to any page.

Thanks for building with us,
The Notion Team

